[{"id":163009656,"discussion_id":"a87629efce0f42848b341684d3eb95226d1d5864","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-14T09:30:13+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163009700,"discussion_id":"612238292d4d0c0b7bc43b849f081269a2262d49","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163009703,"discussion_id":"ec675e498b0d5caf6f9426c33e1a2d0e009dc071","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n SimonZzz, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163009765,"discussion_id":"0074cc480b7a3d549ebb20d5c12292d5da8d510b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复EmbeddingDenseGradV2算子内核在处理索引时的边界条件缺陷。原代码在判断索引有效性时，仅检查了索引是否为填充值或小于零，但未检查索引是否超出权重张量的有效范围（即大于等于权重总数）。这可能导致非法索引被错误处理，进而引发潜在的数组越界访问或数据损坏。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`CopyOutGradWeight`函数的索引有效性判断逻辑中，增加对索引上限的检查。具体修改是在原有的条件`if (idx == tiling_.paddingIdx || idx < 0)`中，追加了`|| idx >= tiling_.numWeights`。这确保了只有当索引在有效范围内（`0 <= idx < tiling_.numWeights`）且不是填充值时，才会执行后续的梯度回写操作，从而防止了因无效索引导致的越界内存访问。","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T11:18:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163032956,"discussion_id":"b059e064590aa65da411d17f47321fd4cdd4daa4","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-12T14:44:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T14:44:29+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}